    <comment>New package: tilth 0.10.1

Tree-sitter based code indexer that answers structural queries
(definitions, references, callers, file outlines) from the CLI or as an
MCP server, instead of reading whole files.

Rust, MIT upstream; the License tag additionally covers the statically
linked non-MIT crates (Apache-2.0 tree-sitter-elixir, BSD-3-Clause
encoding_rs, Zlib foldhash) - derivation is documented in a comment
above the tag. Crates are vendored via cargo_vendor.

Green on x86_64 and aarch64 across Tumbleweed, Slowroll and Leap
16.1/16.0/15.7; 653 tests run in %check; rpmlint clean.</comment>
    <requestid>1376999</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
